HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0540.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0541.fits,spectra0542.fits, spectra0543.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0544.fits,spectra0545.fits, spectra0546.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0547.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.9814536755957088, 0.876672489646885,0.9824191842192005,               HISTORY 1.0167761553044883, 1.0008342308936269,1.0165514139128076,              HISTORY 1.0548230171433763, 0.9991671586703066.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             